  "title": "玉鸟集溜娃",
  "summary": "今天去了良渚文化村。上午去永旺梦乐城参加由孩子王举办的宝宝爬爬赛，草莓爬了第四名，较第三名落后2秒，表现已经不错了。这是草莓第一次参加游戏比赛。中午在永旺的绿茶餐厅吃饭，给岳父补过生日。",
  "content": "<p>今天去了良渚文化村。</p><p>上午去永旺梦乐城参加由孩子王举办的宝宝爬爬赛，草莓爬了第四名，较第三名落后2秒，表现已经不错了。这是草莓第一次参加游戏比赛。中午在永旺的绿茶餐厅吃饭，给岳父补过生日。</p><p><div><figure><img title=\"image-20261115-231942.webp\" src=\"https://skyue-static.com/blog_static/2026/image-20261115-231942.webp\" alt=\"image-20261115-231942.webp\"><figcaption>image-20261115-231942.webp</figcaption></figure><figure><img title=\"image-20261115-231966.webp\" src=\"https://skyue-static.com/blog_static/2026/image-20261115-231966.webp\" alt=\"image-20261115-231966.webp\"><figcaption>image-20261115-231966.webp</figcaption></figure></div></p><p>下午到玉鸟集的星巴克休息，草莓在南瓜怀里睡了个午觉。草莓醒来后，我们便在玉鸟集大草坪铺上南瓜这周买的露营垫，躺平晒太阳，好不惬意。岳父、岳母、南瓜和我围坐着，草莓在中间玩耍、爬行。初冬的阳光暖暖的，很柔和，拍出的照片挺好看的。</p><p><div><figure><img title=\"image-20261115-232038.webp\" src=\"https://skyue-static.com/blog_static/2026/image-20261115-232038.webp\" alt=\"image-20261115-232038.webp\"><figcaption>image-20261115-232038.webp</figcaption></figure><figure><img title=\"image-20261115-231982.webp\" src=\"https://skyue-static.com/blog_static/2026/image-20261115-231982.webp\" alt=\"image-20261115-231982.webp\"><figcaption>image-20261115-231982.webp</figcaption></figure><figure><img title=\"image-20261115-232073.webp\" src=\"https://skyue-static.com/blog_static/2026/image-20261115-232073.webp\" alt=\"image-20261115-232073.webp\"><figcaption>image-20261115-232073.webp</figcaption></figure><figure><img title=\"image-20261115-232077.webp\" src=\"https://skyue-static.com/blog_static/2026/image-20261115-232077.webp\" alt=\"image-20261115-232077.webp\"><figcaption>image-20261115-232077.webp</figcaption></figure><figure><img title=\"image-20261115-232062.webp\" src=\"https://skyue-static.com/blog_static/2026/image-20261115-232062.webp\" alt=\"image-20261115-232062.webp\"><figcaption>image-20261115-232062.webp</figcaption></figure><figure><img title=\"image-20261115-232032.webp\" src=\"https://skyue-static.com/blog_static/2026/image-20261115-232032.webp\" alt=\"image-20261115-232032.webp\"><figcaption>image-20261115-232032.webp</figcaption></figure></div></p><p>周末的玉鸟集非常热闹，停车困难。我绕了几个停车场都没找到车位，最后联系了买下我郡东房子的买家，把车停在了郡东。怀念住在郡东的日子。</p>",
